# Techtalk: How Technology Has Changed Developmental Education.

**Authors:** Caverly, David C., MacDonald, Lucy

## Abstract
Discusses how technology has changed higher education and how it is important to teach developmental students to effectively use technology to become better students and more effective workers. Describes a variety of portable devices and learning strategy applications. Recommends that developmental educators seriously consider the use of Personal Digital Assistants for their low cost and increasing power. (Contains 26 references.) (MZ)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ675209

